# Byte-exact fixture trees. These files are hashed byte-for-byte by the tests
# (tests/unit/FixtureManifestTests.cpp, tests/import-isolation/FixtureManifestTests.cpp,
# tests/import-isolation/UsdProtocolTests.cpp, ...) against checked-in manifests that
# are generated with LF. Never apply end-of-line conversion here: core.autocrlf would
# otherwise rewrite the text fixtures (.gltf, .ply, .usda, manifest.json) to CRLF on
# checkout and every byte-exact assertion would fail on Windows.
interactive-viewer/test-assets/** -text
tests/fixtures/** -text
tests/fuzz/corpus/** -text